    "Like matrix addition (function code 169), use matrix multipli-",
    "cation for system modeling and simulation. The outputs show",
    "the effects of various values of several different parameters.",
    "Matrix multiplication can implement advanced control strate-",
    "gies that incorporate several independent variables."
